      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Mikhail Jekovich reminds Barinov how hard he has worked to earn a Michelin star. Meanwhile, Nikita realizes that the thugs he tipped off are planning to kill Denis rather than just rough him up—and when Nikita threatens to call the police, the thugs kidnap him too!",
